00000000}}\fs22\par\pard\plain\ql\sl275\slmult1\sa192{\f1\fs22\cf0 When clicked (or activated by another means), a hyperlink fires the }{\b\f1\fs22\cf0 RichEditControl.HyperlinkClick}{\f1\fs22\cf0  event.}\fs22\par\pard\plain\ql\sl275\slmult1\sa192{\f1\fs22\cf0 Common hyperlink characteristics, such as the key modifier, required for activating the hyperlink by mouse click, as well as tooltip visibility, can be specified via the }{\b\f1\fs22\cf0 RichEditControlOptions.Hyperlinks}{\f1\fs22\cf0  options of the RichEditControl. For example, to activate a hyperlink with a simple mouse click, without having to hold CTRL key, set the }{\b\f1\fs22\cf0 HyperlinkOptions.ModifierKeys}{\f1\fs22\cf0  to the }{\b\f1\fs22\cf0 System.Windows.Forms.Keys.None}{\f1\fs22\cf0  value.}\fs22\par\pard\plain\ql\sl275\slmult1\sa192{\field{\*\fldinst{\b\f4\fs20\cf12 HYPERLINK \\l "TableOfContents"}}{\fldrslt{\b\f4\fs20\cf12 \u9668\'3c\u9668\'3c back to the Table of Contents}}}{\b\f4\fs20\cf0\cs24 \line }\fs22\par\pard\plain\s20\ql\sl275\slmult1\sb480{\b\cf0 \page }{\*\bkmkstart AdditionalWebResources}{\*\bkmkend AdditionalWebResources}{\b\f3\fs28\cf5 Additional Web Resources}\b\fs28\par\pard\plain\ql\sl275\slmult1\sa192\fs22\par\pard\plain\ql\sl275\slmult1\sa192{\f1\fs22\cf0 To help you better use our software, we provide numerous resources describing the best practices for embedding our XtraRichEdit Suite in your real-life applications.}\fs22\par\pard\plain\ql\sl275\slmult1\sa192{\field{\*\fldinst{\cf0 HYPERLINK "http://www.devexpress.com/Help/?document=XtraRichEdit" \\o "Online Documentation"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\f1\fs22\cf6\cs24 Online Documentation}}}{\f1\fs22\cf0  }\fs22\par\pard\plain\ql\sl275\slmult1\sa192{\f1\fs22\cf0 On the Developer Express Web Site, you have permanent access to the XtraRichEdit's online documentation. The online documentation is easy to use and navigate, and contains the most recent changes which may not yet be included in the offline documentation shipped with the product. }\fs22\par\pard\plain\ql\sl275\slmult1\sa192{\field{\*\fldinst{\cf0 HYPERLINK "https://www.devexpress.com/Support/Center/SearchResults.aspx?searchtext=&p=T4|P1|22" \\o "Support Center & Code Central"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\f1\fs22\cf6\cs24 Support Center & Code Central}}}{\f1\fs22\cf0  }\fs22\par\pard\plain\ql\sl275\slmult1\sa192{\f1\fs22\cf0 Support Center is the primary channel where you can get answers to your questions, report bugs and make suggestions. Whenever you want to create a new issue (ask a question, post a bug or a request) we advise that you look through the currently posted issues. A similar issue may already have been reported, so you'll find a quick answer. }\f1\fs22\par\pard\plain\ql\sl275\slmult1\sa192{\f1\fs22\cf0 The Code Central is designed to make it easier for you to locate sample code, knowledgebase code, code provided by us as part of solving a support incident, etc. It is a web application that lets you search our sample code database, sort or group or filter the results, view a preview of the sample in the grid, or click on it to see the whole thing. All you need to do is click on the sample download button on the website, answer the browser's "what should I do with this file?" security dialog, and after a moment or two, you'll be presented with the sample project in Visual Studio ready for you to peruse the code, or compile and run it. }\fs22\par\pard\plain\ql\sl275\slmult1\sa192{\field{\*\fldinst{\b\f4\fs22\cf12 HYPERLINK \\l "TableOfContents"}}{\fldrslt{\b\f4\fs20\cf12 \u9668\'3c\u9668\'3c back to the Table of Contents}}}\fs28\par}